{{!-- Ammunition Recovery, offered when an encounter ends (book p.102).

      An OFFER, not a grant. The book says a player "may immediately recover"
      half of what they spent, and whether the arrows are retrievable at all is
      a ruling — shots into a river, or into something that ran off, are gone.
      So the card states the arithmetic and waits to be clicked.

      One card for the whole table rather than one per player, because the
      recovery happens at a single moment and a four-player fight would
      otherwise end in four near-identical cards. Each row's button checks
      ownership when clicked; a player can claim their own and a GM anyone's. --}}
<div class="lastarc-card lastarc-card--ammo">

  <header class="lastarc-card__head">
    <div class="lastarc-card__title">
      <span class="lastarc-card__weapon">{{localize "LASTARC.Ammo.RecoveryTitle"}}</span>
      <span class="lastarc-card__sub">{{localize "LASTARC.Ammo.RecoverySub"}}</span>
    </div>
  </header>

  {{#each rows}}
    <div class="lastarc-ammo-row">
      <span class="lastarc-ammo-row__name">{{this.name}}</span>
      <span class="lastarc-ammo-row__items">
        {{~#each this.items}}{{#unless @first}}, {{/unless}}{{this.name}} ×{{this.units}}{{/each~}}
      </span>
      <button type="button" data-action="lastarcRecoverAmmo" data-actor-id="{{this.actorId}}">
        {{localize "LASTARC.Ammo.Recover"}}
      </button>
    </div>
  {{/each}}

</div>
